# The repository already stores every text file with LF. Git for Windows sets
# core.autocrlf=true in its system config by default, which rewrites those files
# to CRLF on checkout and warns on every add — a per-machine setting deciding
# something that belongs to the repo. Declaring it here makes the working tree
# match the index for any clone, on any platform.
#
# Binary files are excluded automatically by text=auto's content detection.
* text=auto eol=lf
